OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMask wearing returns to parts of
OL,4,Ahospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Royal Surrey County Hospital is
OL,7,Fasking patients and visitors to wear
OL,8,Fface masks in certain areas of the site
OL,9,Fto reduce the spread of flu.
OL,11,FAcross the UK, there has been a rise in
OL,12,Fthe cases of flu and other respiratory
OL,13,Finfections, including at the Guildford
OL,14,Fhospital, according to the Royal Surrey
OL,15,FNHS Foundation Trust.
OL,17,FPeople are being urged to wear masks in
OL,18,Fall inpatient wards, the emergency
OL,19,Fdepartment, acute medical unit, cancer
OL,20,Fcentre and Chilworth day unit - which
OL,21,Foffers specialist cancer treatment.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,327,320,200,140,0,100
